title AVG-10 Read AVG Verification Logs · PRD 2.9 · US-10
participant Portal_User
participant Admin_Portal_Backend
participant AVG_Log_Store
participant Service
==PORTAL VIEW==
Portal_User->Admin_Portal_Backend:open verification log (last 30 days; service, result, reason filters)
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:check role + organisation scope
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG_Log_Store:query
AVG_Log_Store-->Admin_Portal_Backend:entries (claim names only, never values)
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:mask holder DID (first 12 + last 4)
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Portal_User:log entries, 20 per page, newest first
==SERVICE LOG API==
Service->AVG_Log_Store:GET verification logs (API key)
AVG_Log_Store-->Service:own entries only, last 30 days
alt OTHER COMPANY SERVICE
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Portal_User:403, attempt logged
end
alt ENTRY OLDER THAN 30 DAYS
AVG_Log_Store->AVG_Log_Store:daily clean-up deletes it
end
